2026-01-01 00:00:00,000[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-call_2d46e4033f7a4bb1be40eb89] execute_python_code({"code": "import numpy as np\n\nA = np.array([0.0, 0.0])\nB = np.array([5.0, 0.0])\nD = np.array([0.0, 12.0])\nC = np.array([5.0, 12.0])\n\nE = np.array([-1.0, 12.0])\n\ndef check_acute(P, Q, R):\n    a = np.linalg.norm(Q-R)  # opposite to P\n    b = np.linalg.norm(P-R)  # opposite to Q\n    c = np.linalg.norm(P-Q)  # opposite to R\n    def ang(a,b,c):\n        if a+b<=c or a+c<=b or b+c<=a: return None\n        cosA = (b*b+c*c-a*a)/(2*b*c)\n        cosB = (a*a+c*c-b*b)/(2*a*c)\n        cosC = (a*a+b*b-c*c)/(2*a*b)\n        return [np.degrees(np.arccos(cosA)), np.degrees(np.arccos(cosB)), np.degrees(np.arccos(cosC))]\n    return ang(a,b,c)\n\nprint(\"Triangle ABE angles:\", check_acute(A,B,E))\nprint(\"Triangle ADE angles:\", check_acute(A,D,E))\nprint(\"Triangle BCE angles:\", check_acute(B,C,E))\nprint(\"Triangle CDE angles:\", check_acute(C,D,E))"}) - MainThread
