implify(d_plus_e))\nprint(\"(d+e)² =\", sp.simplify(d_plus_e**2))\nprint(\"XY² = (d+e)²/2 =\", sp.simplify(d_plus_e**2/2))\nprint(\"XY =\", sp.sqrt(sp.simplify(d_plus_e**2/2)))\n\n# BEAUTIFUL! XY = (d+e)/√2 = (48√2 + 52√2)/√2 = (100√2)/√2 = 100\nprint(\"\\nXY = (d+e)/√2 =\", sp.simplify((48*sp.sqrt(2) + 52*sp.sqrt(2))/sp.sqrt(2)))"}) - MainThread
