o remove exactly total! \n# Hence minimum = all-cost1 = sum floor(i/2) = 1020100.\n\nall_cost1_cost = sum(i//2 for i in range(1,n+1))\nprint(\"minimum turns =\", all_cost1_cost)\n# Let me double check sum floor(i/2), i=1..2020\n# floor(i/2): 0,1,1,2,2,...,1009,1009,1010\n# = 2*(1+2+...+1009) + 1010 = 2*(1009*1010/2)+1010 = 1009*1010+1010 = 1010*(1009+1)=1010*1010=1020100\nprint(\"check:\", 1010*1010)"}) - MainThread
