2*d/24)**2 - (1 - (18/24)**2)*r**2   # |EF|=18 with F on circle\nsol = solve([eq1, eq2], [d, r], dict=True)\nprint(\"Symbolic solutions:\", sol)\n\n# OE = sqrt(72) = 6*sqrt(2); answer form k*sqrt(m): k=6, m=2\nk, m = 6, 2\nprint(\"k =\", k, \" m =\", m, \" k+m =\", k+m)"}) - MainThread
