mum min-turns k:\", best[0], \"->\", best[1])\nprint(\"Top 10 by min turns:\")\ntop = sorted(results, key=lambda x: -x[1])[:10]\nfor k,m in top:\n    print(f\"  k={k}: min turns = {m}\")"}) - MainThread
