inimum acceleration):\")\nprint(\"If M were just barely > m, or friction highest, a would be smallest.\")\n# Minimum a for the system to move: \nprint(\"Actually, let me check what the MINIMUM acceleration is for ANY config:\")\nprint(\"a ranges from ~3.3 (no angle, N=mg) to ~6.6 (no friction).\")\nprint(\"All give 100t > 54.\")"}) - MainThread
